(7047128, 1070517, 122678, '<td valign="top">I am ecstatic and overcome by the success of this piece. This is my best score in a challenge so far. I am honored to be part of this wonderful group of the best photographers in the world. <br/>Wow... thank you for all your wonderful comments on this piece and many others before. You all have given me the inspiration and feedback to bring my work to this point and beyond. <br/>Thank you so much.<br/>Debbi<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-06-03 08:42:42.</i></td>', 'I am ecstatic and overcome by the success of this piece. This is my best score in a challenge so far. I am honored to be part of this wonderful group of the best photographers in the world. Wow... thank you for all your wonderful comments on this piece and many others before. You all have given me the inspiration and feedback to bring my work to this point and beyond. Thank you so much.Debbi', '2013-06-03 07:32:33.000000', '2013-06-03 09:42:42.000000', 0),
