(7047144, 1070618, 113411, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for your comments and support. I shot this through<br/>several layers of glass and through a courtyard. It was a spontaneous<br/>''pick up'' shot and I really am thrilled and so surprised that it placed so<br/>well as I thought I was waxing the definition of ''subtle''.<br/>I really appreciate your votes and comments!<br/>Jane</td>', 'Thanks so much for your comments and support. I shot this throughseveral layers of glass and through a courtyard. It was a spontaneous''pick up'' shot and I really am thrilled and so surprised that it placed sowell as I thought I was waxing the definition of ''subtle''.I really appreciate your votes and comments!Jane', '2013-06-03 08:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
